 },
 "summary": "Three single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 350 mA average forward current and 2.0 A surge. Their reverse voltage ratings are 40 V (SD103AW), 30 V (SD103BW) and 20 V (SD103CW). Forward drop is at most 0.37 V at 20 mA and 0.60 V at 200 mA, with 10 ns reverse recovery, for low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling and reverse-polarity protection.",
